WEBVTT

00:02:57.532 --> 00:03:01.793
i ja kažem, 
"O, zdravo, m-m-moje ime je Meg."

00:03:01.793 --> 00:03:04.200
Zamislite moj užas kad sam shvatila

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.355
da misli da ga ismijavam.

00:03:06.355 --> 00:03:10.450
(Smijeh)

00:03:12.197 --> 00:03:17.230
Ljudi stalno misle da sam pijana.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:20.630
(Smijeh)

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:24.306
Ljudi misle da sam im zaboravila ime

00:03:24.306 --> 00:03:28.997
kad oklijevam prije nego ga kažem.

00:03:28.997 --> 00:03:31.000
I to je vrlo čudno,